WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.139 --> 00:00:12.269
Azerbaijan is that country you didn’t even
know it existed until you watched ‘The World

00:00:12.269 --> 00:00:13.269
is not enough’.

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:15.370
Nonetheless, this country has a lot to offer.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.730
Yes, we are talking again about natural gas.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:24.679
But believe me, there is way more going on
here…

00:00:24.679 --> 00:00:29.619
Vito Corleone used to say ‘family is an
important matter’ and they know this quite

00:00:29.619 --> 00:00:30.619
well in Azerbaijan.

00:00:30.619 --> 00:00:37.100
In fact, the ALIYEV family means everything
in this country.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.539
They control the politics and the economics
with an iron fist.

00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:43.920
Nonetheless, when it comes to negotiating,
they aren’t so much into horse heads in

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.590
beds but rather… caviar!

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:47.360
Yes, you heard that right!

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:51.289
The Aliyev family can be corrupt and repressive
with their own citizens.

00:00:51.289 --> 00:00:54.150
But they know how to treat foreigners like
rockstars.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.770
5 stars hotels, caviar and all kinds of luxuries.

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:01.870
Although, if you’re an EU official watching
this video, and you’re planning to pay a

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:07.020
visit to the Aliyev family… watch your step
because, despite its looks, Baku, Azerbaijan’s

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.729
capital, is not like Las Vegas.

00:01:09.729 --> 00:01:14.799
What happens here will stay… on a videotape,
forever.

00:01:14.799 --> 00:01:21.450
Anyway, doting on foreigners so much, Azerbaijan
has managed to become a member of the Council

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:25.530
of Europe, to participate on the Eurovision
song contest and to even play soccer in the

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:26.570
European cup.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:30.020
All of this despite the fact that they share
a border with Iran.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.140
Yes, Azerbaijan is far from Europe.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.220
But they are Europe’s best friend.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:38.640
And now you might wonder… why is this country
so attractive?

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.650
Well… it’s not just the caviar.

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:44.360
In fact, the Caspian sea has many other interesting
things.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:48.280
They have enormous oil reserves and… also
enormous gas reserves.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:51.159
And do you remember who needs to diversity
their gas suppliers badly?

00:01:51.159 --> 00:01:53.620
Of course, that would be European Union.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:57.310
If you’ve watched the previous videos on
this series about Russian gas, you know Europe

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.409
relies heavily on Russia.

00:01:59.409 --> 00:02:04.110
This is why, corrupted and authoritarian as
they are in Azerbaijan, Brussels needs to

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:07.579
do business with them.

00:02:07.579 --> 00:02:08.890
So now I know what you’re thinking!

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:12.490
Of course Putin will not be happy with this,
right?

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:16.420
At the end of the day, Russia wants Europe
to depend on their gas.

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:20.910
So anytime they look for other providers,
that’s bad news for the Kremlin, right?

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.370
Well… in fact, the opposite is true.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.760
As we said, the Aliyev family has turned diplomacy
into an art form.

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:30.180
And they know how to befriend everyone: including
Putin.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.650
So the question now becomes…

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:34.870
Why is BAKU so important to MOSKOW?

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:39.050
How can Azerbaijan be Europe and Putin’s
friend at the same time?

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.960
And… what does Ukraine have to do with all
of this?

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:46.010
Today we are going to answer all of these
questions but, before we do, let’s take

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:54.300
a look back at the history.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.720
CAVIAR DIPLOMACY
May 2014.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:01.459
The Uruguayan soccer player, DIEGO GODIN scores
the goal that allows the ATLETICO DE MADRID

00:03:01.459 --> 00:03:03.220
team to win the European soccer league.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.730
OK, if you’re American, this doesn’t mean
anything to you.

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:08.310
But outside of America, soccer is a big deal.

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:12.830
So millions of viewers from all over the world
watch a soccer player on their TV screens

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:20.030
with a T-shirt that reads “AZERBAIJAN, LAND
OF FIRE”.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:23.190
This was the case between the years 2012 to
2015.

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:28.500
So now you might wonder… why did Azerbaijan
spend 24 million euros to sponsor a soccer

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.000
team in Spain?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.140
Were they trying to promote tourism?

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:35.920
Have you ever heard anyone say, ‘oh yeah,
I’m going to Azerbaijan this holiday season?’

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.200
Me neither!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.239
No, the answer has nothing to do with tourism.

00:03:40.239 --> 00:03:45.189
As you know, in 2009, Europeans spent several
days without gas because of those gas wars

00:03:45.189 --> 00:03:46.920
between Russia and Ukraine.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:50.830
That was the moment when the European Union
started looking for alternative gas suppliers.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:55.739
At the same time, Azerbaijan was enjoying
a gas boom!

00:03:55.739 --> 00:04:01.620
In 2006, the SHAH DENIZ gas field began production.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:04.379
And this was a big gas field.

00:04:04.379 --> 00:04:08.230
So big that it could help Europe reduce their
Russian dependency by 10%.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:12.190
In other words: Europe was desperately looking
for suppliers and Azerbaijan was desperately

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.090
looking for buyers.

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:16.320
Love was in the air.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:21.300
But, as you know, love needs a spark.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:22.360
A little passion.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.659
And this is where the so called caviar diplomacy
comes in.

00:04:25.659 --> 00:04:28.880
You see, nobody likes to do business with
a dictatorship.

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:32.980
But in Baku, they have money to buy just about
anything.

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:36.669
No one’s willing to sponsor the European
Games because they’re just like the Olympics

00:04:36.669 --> 00:04:39.720
but smaller and they make no financial sense?

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.040
No problem!

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:45.070
Azerbaijan pays with their oil Money!

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:49.770
Valencia, a Spanish city, can no longer host
the Formula ONE?

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:50.770
No problem!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.090
Azerbaijan pays with their oil Money!

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:54.979
Do we need sponsors for the European World
cup?

00:04:54.979 --> 00:04:55.979
No problem!

00:04:55.979 --> 00:04:58.530
Azerbaijan pays with their oil Money!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:03.450
No matter if we’re talking about the brand
‘AZERBAIJAN LAND OF FIRE’ or ‘SOCAR’,

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:08.070
which is Azerbaijan’s oil company: the Aliyev’s
family money is everywhere.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.649
And this explains news like this.

00:05:11.649 --> 00:05:18.690
Euro 2020: get ready for games from Bilbao
to Baku and more minnows

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.690
Yes, you heard that right!

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.250
The next Euro cup will be played in 11 countries.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:28.210
And that includes Azerbaijan, despite not
being European and not having a strong soccer

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.210
tradition.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:31.890
With these kinds of events, Azerbaijan had
a great chance to improve their image and

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.300
buy political goodwill.

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:37.990
Thanks to this, nobody has any problem with
building all the pipelines they want.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:42.190
This is how we have the SOUTH CAUCASUS pipeline,
which connects the Caspian sea with Turkey

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.539
and crosses Georgia.

00:05:43.539 --> 00:05:53.539
This one has been in operation since 2006
and looks like this on a map.

00:05:53.539 --> 00:05:56.120
Yes, yes, I know the pipe looks weird on the
map, right?

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.810
It looks like they were drunk when designing
it.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:02.350
The reason why it’s not a straight line
is because Azerbaijan doesn’t want to cross

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:03.350
Armenia.

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:07.050
The relationship between Armenia and Azerbaijan
is even worse than the relationship between

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.169
Russia and Ukraine.

00:06:09.169 --> 00:06:11.280
This is why they’d rather cross Georgia.

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:17.880
And this is why Russia, who is more pro Armenian,
is not a good friend of the Aliyev family.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.640
But we’ll talk about that later.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:23.640
After this pipeline came the TANAP, which
goes all the way down to Greece.

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:26.310
The TANAP started operation this year, in
2018.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:30.539
And the final project is the so called TAP,
which is expected to go all the way to Italy.

00:06:30.539 --> 00:06:33.560
Now the big question is… what does Putin
think about this?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.909
Well… in the beginning he was far from happy.

00:06:35.909 --> 00:06:41.080
In fact, he tried to stop Azeri gas from arriving
in Italy at any cost.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.080
How did he do it?

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.659
By calling up his Italian friends!

00:06:44.659 --> 00:06:47.219
Remember how Gerhard Schroeder is Putin’s
man in Berlin?

00:06:47.219 --> 00:06:52.250
Well, Putin’s man in Rome is this guy, Beppe
Grillo, the leader of the Five Stars Movement,

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:53.919
a populist party.

00:06:53.919 --> 00:07:00.039
The American Government Warns Italy: Beware
of the Connections Between Russia and the

00:07:00.039 --> 00:07:03.580
5 Stars Movement
And this is why Beppe Grillo used to say things

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:04.909
like this.

00:07:04.909 --> 00:07:11.870
“If they wanna make this pipe in PUGLIA,
from any other place, we will bring the army

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:14.789
if necessary”
Let’s pause it right here!

00:07:14.789 --> 00:07:17.070
This declaration is from 2014.

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:19.839
But we make this video in 2018.

00:07:19.839 --> 00:07:21.390
Four years is a long time.

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:31.219
So let’s fast forward and see what happened
since then.

00:07:31.219 --> 00:07:35.460
EVERYTHING REMAINS AT HOME
Every dynasty has a godfather: this is the

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:37.240
story of HEYDAR ALIYEV.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:39.180
He started his career as a KGB spy.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:42.520
For 25 years he was the James Bond of Baku.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:47.550
Then, in 1969, Soviet General Secretary Leonid
Brezhnev named him the leader of the Soviet

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.190
Republic of Azerbaijan.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:53.820
His political career soared until the 80s,
when he had his problems with later General

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.709
Secretary Mikhail Gorbachev.

00:07:56.709 --> 00:08:00.551
Then, in 1991, Azerbaijan gained independence.

00:08:00.551 --> 00:08:08.560
In 2 years, HEYDAR ALIYEV had become the president
with… pay attention, 98.8% of the vote.

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:11.760
Yes, this is the Azerbaijan style of democracy.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.940
Nonetheless, Heydar was a man of compromise.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.410
He used to be a good communist.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:18.410
But he easily adapted to the capitalistic
Framework.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:26.180
In less than a year, he signed the so called,
contract of the Century: British BP, the American

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:31.220
Exxon and Chevron, the Norwegian Statoil…
all of them wanted to have their share of

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.980
Azerbaijan’s gas and oil.

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:36.789
And Aliyev was happy to give it to them in
exchange for a juicy 80% of the profits.

00:08:36.789 --> 00:08:37.789
In fact…

00:08:37.789 --> 00:08:40.260
do you remember that James Bond movie called
‘The world is not enough’?

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:44.940
It opened with that scene where Pierce Brosnan
is driving a car through oil rigs in this

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:45.940
country.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.870
And, as a side tip for you, dear viewers,
James Bond is a great geopolitical compass.

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:53.520
Any time they choose a location for shooting
it’s because that country is very interested

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.310
in appearing in a movie.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.980
And if they’re interested, it’s usually
for a reason.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:59.220
So going back to our movie…

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:00.660
Azerbaijan’s economy skyrocketed since then.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:03.830
They had oil, they had gas and they had caviar.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:08.060
The country grew and so did the corruption.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.060
Everything remains in the family business.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:14.890
And, as Vito Corleone used to say, ‘a man
who doesn’t spend time with his family can

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:16.440
never be a real man’.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:23.820
So, upon the death of the godfather, HEYDAR
ALIYEV, in 2003, his son ILHAM inherited the

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.780
business.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:28.990
This time, he won the elections with 75% of
the vote.

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:32.170
Yes, you know, Azerbaijan’s style of democracy
is very very funny.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:38.410
If you don’t believe me, just look at this
news…

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:45.130
Oops: Azerbaijan released election results
before voting had even started

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:49.300
In fact, ILHAN ALIYEV doesn’t even waste
time pretending not to be corrupt.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:53.270
He changed the Constitution so he can run
for elections as many times as he wants.

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:56.590
The Vice president of the country is his wife.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:59.660
And he also changed the law that specified
the required age to run for elections.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:02.500
Before, you had to be older than 35 to run
for President.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.460
But his son is only 21 and… you never know!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:09.640
And of course, anybody who speaks against
the Aliyev family ends up in jail.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:11.960
Meanwhile, they’re getting richer and richer
every year.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.430
Do you remember the Panama papers?

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:16.420
Well, one of the biggest clients of MOSSACK
FONSECA’s company was the Aliyev.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:20.310
So… what do you do when you have as much
money as they do?

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:22.970
You use it to make friends!

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:27.450
Corruption inquiry at Council of Europe over
Azerbaijan

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.560
But, OK, we still haven’t answered the big
question.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.300
How did they manage to befriend Putin?

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:34.620
OK, we’re going to tell you right now!

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:40.720
REALPOLITIK
Michael Corleone used to say: keep your friends

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:42.110
close, but your enemies closer.

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:51.220
If you remember, Vladimir Putin has two goals
on his agenda: one is to sell gas to Europe,

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:54.070
the other is to bypass Ukraine on the gas
transit.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:57.800
After the gas wars, the Nord Stream 1 and
the Nord Stream 2 were built.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:01.020
Those pipelines connect directly Russia and
Germany through the Baltic sea.

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.280
But this isn’t enough.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:06.730
If they want to isolate Ukraine forever, they
need more pipes in the South.

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:08.330
And that’s harder than it looks.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:14.050
Look at what happened when they tried the
first time.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:17.540
Bulgaria suspends South Stream gas pipeline
project

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:21.460
Unlike Azerbaijan, Putin isn’t so brilliant
when it comes to diplomacy.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:26.071
The Crimea invasion cost him a lot of economic
sanctions and made Europe stop that pipeline

00:11:26.071 --> 00:11:27.880
the Kremlin wanted to build.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:30.360
So Putin had to look for a better strategy.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:34.210
And… with this in mind, the Azerbaijan pipe
didn’t look that bad anymore.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:39.040
You see, if Europe is investing in having
a pipe in the South to get gas from Azerbaijan…

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.400
Russia can also send their gas through it.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.570
And this is how the TURKSTREAM was born.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.560
TURKSTREAM is another pipe that goes from
Russia to Turkey.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:52.430
But once it gets to Turkey… you can also
connect it with the other pipe that goes to

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:53.430
Italy.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:58.980
Just look at this map.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.610
In other words, Russia’s play goes as follows.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.770
They bring the gas to Turkey, from there it
goes to Italy.

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:08.990
So that pipe that was originally designed
to be for Azerbaijan’s gas, will carry Russian

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:09.990
gas too.

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:15.190
In other words, the Aliyev family is no longer
a threat to Putin but an opportunity.

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.279
Things have changed in Russia.

00:12:16.279 --> 00:12:17.279
And things have changed in Italy too.

00:12:17.279 --> 00:12:21.000
Remember how the Five Stars Movement was completely
against the TAP pipeline?

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:24.580
Well, now the Five Stars Movement is one of
the ruling parties in Italy.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:27.930
And… look what they say now!

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:34.490
Di Maio: “TAP is not strategic but it is
shielded”

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:42.490
Meanwhile, there are two World leaders that
have become really good friends.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.800
This looks like the ending to a Hollywood
movie.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:48.870
The European Union is happy because now they
can diversify their gas supply.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:52.750
Azerbaijan is happy too, because now they’re
going to become enormously rich.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:56.270
Russia is happy as well because they can bypass
Ukraine once and for all.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.950
Yes, everybody is happy.

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:00.110
Well… everybody except Ukraine.

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:03.800
They most likely have a very dark future.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.270
So now I have a question for you.

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:08.710
Do you think Europe will let Putin achieve
his goals with Ukraine?

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:13.060
Do you think the Aliyev family will keep running
the country as a family business?

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:14.590
What do you think will happen with Ukraine?

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:16.860
Please, leave your answer in the comment section
below.

